### Se om man är inloggad
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-in/email
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "myname@icloud.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###Hämta alla produkter för adminvyn, alla nedan kräver att man är inloggad!
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/


###Hämta en specifik produkt, avänder samma som ovanför + produktNr
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/115


###Skapa en ny produkt 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test product",
  "description": "This is a test product created via API",
  "image": "/assets/images/Paris_Sepia_Grey.jpg",
  "price": 499,
  "salePrice": 349,
  "articleNumber": "TEST-1001",
  "category": ["Bestseller", "Sale"]
}


###Uppdatera en produkt
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/TEST-1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "/assets/images/Paris_black_1.webp"
}


###Radera en produkt
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/TEST-1001
